{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252360/extras/37d98907abd54dd0c63d2d08a4bfe36f.poster.avif?t=1773530125\" width=1024 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252360/extras/37d98907abd54dd0c63d2d08a4bfe36f.webm?t=1773530125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252360/extras/37d98907abd54dd0c63d2d08a4bfe36f.mp4?t=1773530125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How long can you survive unemployment?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2018, you are trapped in a single-bedroom apartment somewhere in an undisclosed Nordic welfare state. Your objective is to survive in the mind-numbing loop of long-term unemployment and social isolation. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252360/extras/c447ceadeba16d7ad8e8d12ff2175db9.poster.avif?t=1773530125\" width=634 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252360/extras/c447ceadeba16d7ad8e8d12ff2175db9.webm?t=1773530125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252360/extras/c447ceadeba16d7ad8e8d12ff2175db9.mp4?t=1773530125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival</strong> <br> You have stats to manage: the physiological needs of the body, and your mental health. Maintain high dopamine levels to avoid a literal death by boredom. Eat, drink (responsibly), use the toilet, wash yourself, hide from responsibilities, and keep yourself sufficiently entertained. Just stay alive, ok? Survive the week. It'll get better.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252360/extras/c4ddc7084e317fba62fcd39aedd5be99.poster.avif?t=1773530125\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252360/extras/c4ddc7084e317fba62fcd39aedd5be99.webm?t=1773530125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252360/extras/c4ddc7084e317fba62fcd39aedd5be99.mp4?t=1773530125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-driven</strong><br>Advance through your personal story. You survived the day? Then you can go to sleep. Something's calling you. You\u2019ll find an escape in your dreams. It\u2019s when you sleep that you are most alive. In fact, you can be anything in your dreams. A salaryman. A husband. A hero! <br><br>Until the alarm goes off again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Haunted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3252360/586633fd290f12b0095e8c79eca72d0029137f4c.jpg"},{"name":"Time to Cry","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3252360/0dcb440a1f125a031ad15321f905412519fbc62a.jpg"},{"name":"Bullseye","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3252360/750c14949f0c16a0c667dae0c32f1cc43d8f8e32.jpg"},{"name":"Obsessive Cleaning Disorder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3252360/6a0c5d2d47546af972647361fe7971e799b0f7e7.jpg"},{"name":"Blood of My Blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3252360/d1711cdf2e29bc9f1cfb37063b41455fabd24f6b.jpg"},{"name":"Birth of a New Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3252360/6b4a558c9e10ecf04989a88be33730ca1f442e63.jpg"},{"name":"Mindful Washing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3252360/1e788c39717508e96b22a0c4f6be0d88153a71b2.jpg"},{"name":"Conspiracy Theory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3252360/b596fb5989f9e506fade93283eebeece32f280a0.jpg"},{"name":"The Leak","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3252360/99442a41f57a831f5f0ea53bee849dbb79ab6ee8.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3252360?t=1773530125","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252360/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773530125","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252360/da9239dc8bfbbd9a6aef315564aa2e94d0d12953/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773530125","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252360/da9239dc8bfbbd9a6aef315564aa2e94d0d12953/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773530125","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Depiction of depression, mild nudity, alcohol consumption"},"detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted pixel art <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comedy, drama, and maybe trauma</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack by Wilson Tanner Smith</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset